            "text": "Helper acquisition failure remains non-fatal by product decision, but the warning now leads with an explicit native-helper warning and names best-effort mode so operators cannot mistake deterministic output for Chromium parity. The existing static-chain gate supplies the functional fallback; this change intentionally does not alter routing.",
            "markdown": "Helper acquisition failure remains non-fatal by product decision, but the warning now leads with an explicit native-helper warning and names best-effort mode so operators cannot mistake deterministic output for Chromium parity. The existing static-chain gate supplies the functional fallback; this change intentionally does not alter routing."
          },
