                    "text": "  warnOnce(`WARNING: native glyph helper (${target.asset}) is unavailable — continuing in best-effort degraded font mode. Output remains deterministic and functional, but installed-family selection, fallback faces, traits, axes, and pixels may differ from Chromium on this host. Set DOMOTION_HELPER_PATH to a matching helper or pre-warm with acquireGlyphHelper() to restore live platform resolution.`);"
                  }
